  "source_title": "应县木塔进不了前三？盘点中国最不可思议古塔，第十到第六：斜塔、神合、十二边形，一座比一座悬#中国古塔#中国古建筑#历史文化#传统文化",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_54305777bc2e5896_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 410.738005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家现存的古塔，有名有姓的不下两千座，可要问哪一座最不可思议？那争议可就大了。有人说是硬线木塔，全木头搭的，每一根钉挨了二百多发炮弹，扛了四十多发地震。有人说是大理三塔，一千多年，镇住水患，屹立不倒错。真要论起邪乎，桥进应县木塔，连前三都进不去。今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十座古塔。先讲第十到第六，一个比一个悬。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。江苏苏州虎丘塔，鉴于五代后周，公元九百五十九年，比意大利的比萨斜塔还早了两百多年。这塔最绝的地方就一个字，鞋从明朝开始，塔身就往西北倾斜，现在塔尖偏离中心，两米三十四，倾斜度将近三度，人称中国的比萨斜塔。您可能要问了，斜了怎么不倒明朝？崇祯年间，工匠发现他歪了，修第七层的时候故意往反方向砌，想把重心掰回来，结果掰过头了，整座塔变成了香蕉，形歪上加歪，反倒站稳了一千多年了。台风也吹过，地震也晃过，他就是斜着站不倒。您说这是歪打正着还是手艺？太精第九名陕西西安小雁塔建于唐朝，公元七百零七年，为了存放高僧，从印度带回来的经卷。这塔最邪乎的地方不是冷，是他会自己合。明朝成化二十三年，陕西大地震，六级小雁塔中间从上到下裂了一条一尺多宽的缝。当时人都觉得这塔完了，结果三十四年以后又一次大地震那条缝一夜之间自己合上了。后来又列了两次，又合了两次，三次裂三次合。老百姓管他叫神和科学家研究了半天，说是因为塔身结构特殊，裂缝以后，重心还偏向，中间小地震，一晃反而往中间聚。您说这塔是成精了，还是古人把力学算到了骨头里？第八名，河南登峰松月寺塔建于北魏，公元五百二十年左右，中国现存最古老的砖塔一千五百年了，这塔最绝的地方是它的形状。中国古塔千千万方的圆的八角的，唯独这一座是十二边形，全国找不到第二座。建筑学家。罗哲文先生说过，这塔的建筑结构艺术造型堪称爵响和第一，而且是古代唯一一座十二边形十五层塔的孤立。孤立什么意思？就是他自己一个没有同类，没有后代，中国古塔从它开始。可他这个造型后面再也没人复制过一座塔，站在嵩山脚下孤零零站了一千五百年，您说他是开路先锋还是天外来客第七名？云南大理崇圣寺三塔主塔叫千寻塔，鉴于唐朝南诏时期，公元八百多年高六十九点一、三米十六层，这个高度算得上是摩天大厦。这塔最绝的地方不是高，是怎么修的？大理古时候是个泽国，水患，多修塔，除了弘扬佛法，还要镇水，怎么把这么高的塔修起来的，用的是堆土建塔法垫一层土，修一层塔，再垫一层土，再修一层一直堆到塔顶，然后从上面往下一层一层挖土，它就出来了，这就叫堆土践踏，挖土陷塌。一千多年里，大理经历了三十多次强地震。一九二五年大地震，大理城里民房倒了百分之九十九，千寻塔就掉了顶上的宝刹。踏身纹丝不动，您说这堆土法是笨办法？还是大智慧。第六名，浙江杭州六合塔建于北宋开宝三年，公元九百七十年，吴越王钱弘横为了镇江潮修的这塔最绝的地方不在塔本身。在塔里的人水浒传里，鲁智深跟着宋江打完方腊，驻扎在六合塔，半夜听见钱塘江潮水响，以为是战鼓，抄起禅杖就要冲出去。和尚告诉他在，不是战鼓，是朝信。鲁智深一听，想起师傅，说过听朝而园见信而济。当天晚上，沐浴更衣，坐在六合塔里圆寂了，后来武松也不跟宋江回去见皇帝了，留在六合塔出家，一直活到八十岁一座塔，送走了一个花河，尚，留住了一个打虎英雄。您说这塔是镇江朝的还是收人心的？从第十到第六，虎丘塔斜了一千年，不到小雁塔列了三次，自己合上松。岳寺塔是全国唯一的十二边形大理三塔堆土，修了千年不塌，六和塔送走了鲁智深，留住了五苏可，这五座还不是最邪乎的。接下来第五道第一，一座比一座悬有一座塔，全木头搭的没一根钉，挨了二百多发炮弹四十多次，地震还站着，还有一座塔，地宫打开，全世界都轰动了，他是哪座？他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00001",
      "start_ms": 150,
      "end_ms": 870,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1150,
      "end_ms": 3030,
      "text": "咱们国家现存的古塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3810,
      "end_ms": 6330,
      "text": "有名有姓的不下两千座，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6650,
      "end_ms": 9730,
      "text": "可要问哪一座最不可思议？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10570,
      "end_ms": 12130,
      "text": "那争议可就大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13570,
      "end_ms": 15430,
      "text": "有人说是硬线木塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00007",
      "start_ms": 15890,
      "end_ms": 16910,
      "text": "全木头搭的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16930,
      "end_ms": 19370,
      "text": "每一根钉挨了二百多发炮弹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00009",
      "start_ms": 19530,
      "end_ms": 20990,
      "text": "扛了四十多发地震。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21230,
      "end_ms": 23070,
      "text": "有人说是大理三塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00011",
      "start_ms": 23310,
      "end_ms": 24390,
      "text": "一千多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00012",
      "start_ms": 24690,
      "end_ms": 25650,
      "text": "镇住水患，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00013",
      "start_ms": 25830,
      "end_ms": 28130,
      "text": "屹立不倒错。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00014",
      "start_ms": 28650,
      "end_ms": 29870,
      "text": "真要论起邪乎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00015",
      "start_ms": 29870,
      "end_ms": 31520,
      "text": "桥进应县木塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00016",
      "start_ms": 31520,
      "end_ms": 33160,
      "text": "连前三都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00017",
      "start_ms": 33720,
      "end_ms": 39260,
      "text": "今天咱们就来盘点中国最不可思议的十座古塔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00018",
      "start_ms": 39440,
      "end_ms": 41300,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00019",
      "start_ms": 41600,
      "end_ms": 42560,
      "text": "一个比一个悬。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00020",
      "start_ms": 43240,
      "end_ms": 43940,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00021",
      "start_ms": 44220,
      "end_ms": 45080,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00022",
      "start_ms": 45440,
      "end_ms": 47460,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00023",
      "start_ms": 47720,
      "end_ms": 50640,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00024",
      "start_ms": 51100,
      "end_ms": 52720,
      "text": "江苏苏州虎丘塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00025",
      "start_ms": 53100,
      "end_ms": 55000,
      "text": "鉴于五代后周，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00026",
      "start_ms": 55380,
      "end_ms": 57040,
      "text": "公元九百五十九年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00027",
      "start_ms": 57400,
      "end_ms": 61525,
      "text": "比意大利的比萨斜塔还早了两百多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00028",
      "start_ms": 62360,
      "end_ms": 65835,
      "text": "这塔最绝的地方就一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00029",
      "start_ms": 66180,
      "end_ms": 69585,
      "text": "鞋从明朝开始，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00030",
      "start_ms": 70050,
      "end_ms": 72045,
      "text": "塔身就往西北倾斜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00031",
      "start_ms": 72620,
      "end_ms": 74225,
      "text": "现在塔尖偏离中心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00032",
      "start_ms": 74730,
      "end_ms": 75790,
      "text": "两米三十四，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00033",
      "start_ms": 76110,
      "end_ms": 78025,
      "text": "倾斜度将近三度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00034",
      "start_ms": 78510,
      "end_ms": 80570,
      "text": "人称中国的比萨斜塔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00035",
      "start_ms": 80690,
      "end_ms": 81810,
      "text": "您可能要问了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00036",
      "start_ms": 81930,
      "end_ms": 84440,
      "text": "斜了怎么不倒明朝？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00037",
      "start_ms": 84480,
      "end_ms": 85325,
      "text": "崇祯年间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00038",
      "start_ms": 85690,
      "end_ms": 87645,
      "text": "工匠发现他歪了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00039",
      "start_ms": 88370,
      "end_ms": 91535,
      "text": "修第七层的时候故意往反方向砌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00040",
      "start_ms": 92210,
      "end_ms": 93665,
      "text": "想把重心掰回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00041",
      "start_ms": 94780,
      "end_ms": 95845,
      "text": "结果掰过头了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00042",
      "start_ms": 96240,
      "end_ms": 97980,
      "text": "整座塔变成了香蕉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00043",
      "start_ms": 98040,
      "end_ms": 99800,
      "text": "形歪上加歪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00044",
      "start_ms": 100000,
      "end_ms": 102965,
      "text": "反倒站稳了一千多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00045",
      "start_ms": 103240,
      "end_ms": 104480,
      "text": "台风也吹过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00046",
      "start_ms": 104680,
      "end_ms": 106025,
      "text": "地震也晃过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00047",
      "start_ms": 106360,
      "end_ms": 108020,
      "text": "他就是斜着站不倒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00048",
      "start_ms": 108200,
      "end_ms": 110980,
      "text": "您说这是歪打正着还是手艺？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00049",
      "start_ms": 110980,
      "end_ms": 115785,
      "text": "太精第九名陕西西安小雁塔建于唐朝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00050",
      "start_ms": 116150,
      "end_ms": 117450,
      "text": "公元七百零七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00051",
      "start_ms": 117590,
      "end_ms": 118810,
      "text": "为了存放高僧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00052",
      "start_ms": 118890,
      "end_ms": 120885,
      "text": "从印度带回来的经卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00053",
      "start_ms": 121390,
      "end_ms": 123895,
      "text": "这塔最邪乎的地方不是冷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00054",
      "start_ms": 124140,
      "end_ms": 125345,
      "text": "是他会自己合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00055",
      "start_ms": 125900,
      "end_ms": 127560,
      "text": "明朝成化二十三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00056",
      "start_ms": 127880,
      "end_ms": 129095,
      "text": "陕西大地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00057",
      "start_ms": 129370,
      "end_ms": 135145,
      "text": "六级小雁塔中间从上到下裂了一条一尺多宽的缝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00058",
      "start_ms": 135810,
      "end_ms": 138275,
      "text": "当时人都觉得这塔完了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00059",
      "start_ms": 138610,
      "end_ms": 146095,
      "text": "结果三十四年以后又一次大地震那条缝一夜之间自己合上了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00060",
      "start_ms": 147400,
      "end_ms": 149135,
      "text": "后来又列了两次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00061",
      "start_ms": 149990,
      "end_ms": 151050,
      "text": "又合了两次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00062",
      "start_ms": 151330,
      "end_ms": 153105,
      "text": "三次裂三次合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00063",
      "start_ms": 154410,
      "end_ms": 159090,
      "text": "老百姓管他叫神和科学家研究了半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00064",
      "start_ms": 159410,
      "end_ms": 162165,
      "text": "说是因为塔身结构特殊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00065",
      "start_ms": 162690,
      "end_ms": 163470,
      "text": "裂缝以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00066",
      "start_ms": 163510,
      "end_ms": 164770,
      "text": "重心还偏向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00067",
      "start_ms": 164830,
      "end_ms": 166530,
      "text": "中间小地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00068",
      "start_ms": 166530,
      "end_ms": 168625,
      "text": "一晃反而往中间聚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00069",
      "start_ms": 169160,
      "end_ms": 170775,
      "text": "您说这塔是成精了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00070",
      "start_ms": 171140,
      "end_ms": 173605,
      "text": "还是古人把力学算到了骨头里？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00071",
      "start_ms": 174270,
      "end_ms": 174925,
      "text": "第八名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00072",
      "start_ms": 175600,
      "end_ms": 178985,
      "text": "河南登峰松月寺塔建于北魏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00073",
      "start_ms": 179430,
      "end_ms": 181425,
      "text": "公元五百二十年左右，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00074",
      "start_ms": 181900,
      "end_ms": 185945,
      "text": "中国现存最古老的砖塔一千五百年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00075",
      "start_ms": 186350,
      "end_ms": 189595,
      "text": "这塔最绝的地方是它的形状。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00076",
      "start_ms": 190040,
      "end_ms": 194035,
      "text": "中国古塔千千万方的圆的八角的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00077",
      "start_ms": 194410,
      "end_ms": 197005,
      "text": "唯独这一座是十二边形，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00078",
      "start_ms": 197360,
      "end_ms": 198945,
      "text": "全国找不到第二座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00079",
      "start_ms": 199820,
      "end_ms": 200620,
      "text": "建筑学家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00080",
      "start_ms": 200740,
      "end_ms": 202225,
      "text": "罗哲文先生说过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00081",
      "start_ms": 203050,
      "end_ms": 209075,
      "text": "这塔的建筑结构艺术造型堪称爵响和第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00082",
      "start_ms": 209880,
      "end_ms": 215245,
      "text": "而且是古代唯一一座十二边形十五层塔的孤立。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00083",
      "start_ms": 215580,
      "end_ms": 216555,
      "text": "孤立什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00084",
      "start_ms": 216950,
      "end_ms": 219500,
      "text": "就是他自己一个没有同类，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00085",
      "start_ms": 219720,
      "end_ms": 220560,
      "text": "没有后代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00086",
      "start_ms": 220760,
      "end_ms": 222555,
      "text": "中国古塔从它开始。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00087",
      "start_ms": 223150,
      "end_ms": 227460,
      "text": "可他这个造型后面再也没人复制过一座塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00088",
      "start_ms": 227620,
      "end_ms": 231055,
      "text": "站在嵩山脚下孤零零站了一千五百年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00089",
      "start_ms": 231950,
      "end_ms": 235865,
      "text": "您说他是开路先锋还是天外来客第七名？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00090",
      "start_ms": 236280,
      "end_ms": 240935,
      "text": "云南大理崇圣寺三塔主塔叫千寻塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00091",
      "start_ms": 241780,
      "end_ms": 243765,
      "text": "鉴于唐朝南诏时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00092",
      "start_ms": 244520,
      "end_ms": 249120,
      "text": "公元八百多年高六十九点一、三米十六层，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00093",
      "start_ms": 249220,
      "end_ms": 251655,
      "text": "这个高度算得上是摩天大厦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00094",
      "start_ms": 252630,
      "end_ms": 255695,
      "text": "这塔最绝的地方不是高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00095",
      "start_ms": 256430,
      "end_ms": 257335,
      "text": "是怎么修的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00096",
      "start_ms": 258280,
      "end_ms": 260125,
      "text": "大理古时候是个泽国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00097",
      "start_ms": 260870,
      "end_ms": 261430,
      "text": "水患，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00098",
      "start_ms": 261470,
      "end_ms": 263380,
      "text": "多修塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00099",
      "start_ms": 263460,
      "end_ms": 264935,
      "text": "除了弘扬佛法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00100",
      "start_ms": 265350,
      "end_ms": 266235,
      "text": "还要镇水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00101",
      "start_ms": 266680,
      "end_ms": 268985,
      "text": "怎么把这么高的塔修起来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00102",
      "start_ms": 269250,
      "end_ms": 272855,
      "text": "用的是堆土建塔法垫一层土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00103",
      "start_ms": 273300,
      "end_ms": 274225,
      "text": "修一层塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00104",
      "start_ms": 274630,
      "end_ms": 275650,
      "text": "再垫一层土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00105",
      "start_ms": 275810,
      "end_ms": 278095,
      "text": "再修一层一直堆到塔顶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00106",
      "start_ms": 278360,
      "end_ms": 281040,
      "text": "然后从上面往下一层一层挖土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00107",
      "start_ms": 281240,
      "end_ms": 282185,
      "text": "它就出来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00108",
      "start_ms": 282540,
      "end_ms": 284530,
      "text": "这就叫堆土践踏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00109",
      "start_ms": 284790,
      "end_ms": 286105,
      "text": "挖土陷塌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00110",
      "start_ms": 286750,
      "end_ms": 287830,
      "text": "一千多年里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00111",
      "start_ms": 287990,
      "end_ms": 291065,
      "text": "大理经历了三十多次强地震。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00112",
      "start_ms": 291610,
      "end_ms": 293475,
      "text": "一九二五年大地震，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00113",
      "start_ms": 294460,
      "end_ms": 296705,
      "text": "大理城里民房倒了百分之九十九，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00114",
      "start_ms": 297550,
      "end_ms": 300095,
      "text": "千寻塔就掉了顶上的宝刹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00115",
      "start_ms": 300950,
      "end_ms": 302265,
      "text": "踏身纹丝不动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00116",
      "start_ms": 303170,
      "end_ms": 307025,
      "text": "您说这堆土法是笨办法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00117",
      "start_ms": 307450,
      "end_ms": 308710,
      "text": "还是大智慧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00118",
      "start_ms": 308930,
      "end_ms": 309550,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00119",
      "start_ms": 309730,
      "end_ms": 313210,
      "text": "浙江杭州六合塔建于北宋开宝三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00120",
      "start_ms": 313390,
      "end_ms": 314710,
      "text": "公元九百七十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00121",
      "start_ms": 314830,
      "end_ms": 321290,
      "text": "吴越王钱弘横为了镇江潮修的这塔最绝的地方不在塔本身。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00122",
      "start_ms": 321830,
      "end_ms": 323850,
      "text": "在塔里的人水浒传里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00123",
      "start_ms": 324030,
      "end_ms": 326430,
      "text": "鲁智深跟着宋江打完方腊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00124",
      "start_ms": 326610,
      "end_ms": 328230,
      "text": "驻扎在六合塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00125",
      "start_ms": 328650,
      "end_ms": 331030,
      "text": "半夜听见钱塘江潮水响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00126",
      "start_ms": 331230,
      "end_ms": 332230,
      "text": "以为是战鼓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00127",
      "start_ms": 332650,
      "end_ms": 334690,
      "text": "抄起禅杖就要冲出去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00128",
      "start_ms": 335050,
      "end_ms": 336430,
      "text": "和尚告诉他在，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00129",
      "start_ms": 336430,
      "end_ms": 337175,
      "text": "不是战鼓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00130",
      "start_ms": 337420,
      "end_ms": 338140,
      "text": "是朝信。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00131",
      "start_ms": 339220,
      "end_ms": 340100,
      "text": "鲁智深一听，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00132",
      "start_ms": 340400,
      "end_ms": 341140,
      "text": "想起师傅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00133",
      "start_ms": 341140,
      "end_ms": 344540,
      "text": "说过听朝而园见信而济。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00134",
      "start_ms": 345280,
      "end_ms": 346220,
      "text": "当天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00135",
      "start_ms": 346440,
      "end_ms": 347400,
      "text": "沐浴更衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00136",
      "start_ms": 348100,
      "end_ms": 350760,
      "text": "坐在六合塔里圆寂了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00137",
      "start_ms": 351420,
      "end_ms": 355000,
      "text": "后来武松也不跟宋江回去见皇帝了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00138",
      "start_ms": 355100,
      "end_ms": 356560,
      "text": "留在六合塔出家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00139",
      "start_ms": 356800,
      "end_ms": 359200,
      "text": "一直活到八十岁一座塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00140",
      "start_ms": 359640,
      "end_ms": 360920,
      "text": "送走了一个花河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00141",
      "start_ms": 360920,
      "end_ms": 361160,
      "text": "尚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00142",
      "start_ms": 361400,
      "end_ms": 363020,
      "text": "留住了一个打虎英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00143",
      "start_ms": 363540,
      "end_ms": 366975,
      "text": "您说这塔是镇江朝的还是收人心的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00144",
      "start_ms": 367380,
      "end_ms": 369125,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00145",
      "start_ms": 370180,
      "end_ms": 371660,
      "text": "虎丘塔斜了一千年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00146",
      "start_ms": 371660,
      "end_ms": 374120,
      "text": "不到小雁塔列了三次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00147",
      "start_ms": 374360,
      "end_ms": 376250,
      "text": "自己合上松。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00148",
      "start_ms": 376250,
      "end_ms": 380920,
      "text": "岳寺塔是全国唯一的十二边形大理三塔堆土，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00149",
      "start_ms": 380920,
      "end_ms": 382495,
      "text": "修了千年不塌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00150",
      "start_ms": 382930,
      "end_ms": 384785,
      "text": "六和塔送走了鲁智深，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00151",
      "start_ms": 385110,
      "end_ms": 386790,
      "text": "留住了五苏可，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00152",
      "start_ms": 386790,
      "end_ms": 388825,
      "text": "这五座还不是最邪乎的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00153",
      "start_ms": 389430,
      "end_ms": 391130,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00154",
      "start_ms": 391250,
      "end_ms": 393330,
      "text": "一座比一座悬有一座塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00155",
      "start_ms": 393650,
      "end_ms": 395555,
      "text": "全木头搭的没一根钉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00156",
      "start_ms": 395920,
      "end_ms": 398400,
      "text": "挨了二百多发炮弹四十多次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00157",
      "start_ms": 398400,
      "end_ms": 399635,
      "text": "地震还站着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00158",
      "start_ms": 399970,
      "end_ms": 400850,
      "text": "还有一座塔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00159",
      "start_ms": 401130,
      "end_ms": 401970,
      "text": "地宫打开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00160",
      "start_ms": 402210,
      "end_ms": 403535,
      "text": "全世界都轰动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00161",
      "start_ms": 404090,
      "end_ms": 404845,
      "text": "他是哪座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00162",
      "start_ms": 405220,
      "end_ms": 407615,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_54305777bc2e5896_s00163",
      "start_ms": 408100,
      "end_ms": 410635,
      "text": "您先点个关注点开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
